[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2628623290","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102260#issuecomment-2628623290","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102260","id":2628623290,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6crZu6","user":{"login":"Hilderin","id":81109165,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTA5MTY1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81109165?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin","html_url":"https://github.com/Hilderin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-01T00:37:15Z","updated_at":"2025-02-01T00:37:15Z","body":"I'm concerned a bit with this solution because it does not really prevent 2 scans to be executed at the same time. 2 scans at the same time could lead to a corruption of `EditorFileSystem::filesystem`.\r\n\r\nI think the real issue is that a scan is started in `FileSystemDock::_move_operation_confirm` when `is_copied` is true at line 1972 while `_try_duplicate_item` and `EditorFileSystem::copy_file` queued a `refresh_filesystem` in `EditorFileSystem`.\r\nThen, we have 2 scans running at the same time.\r\n\r\nFirst, I think the rescan in `FileSystemDock::_move_operation_confirm` is useless following #97090. I tested, and just that fixes the issue.\r\n\r\nSecond, I think to avoid this problem elsewhere in the future, a much global way to fix that should be to prevent 2 scans at the same time. I suggest:\r\n- Adding a check on `refresh_queued` In `EditorFileSystem::scan()` and `EditorFileSystem::scan_changes` to skip the scan if a refresh is queued.\r\n- Adding a check on `if (scanning || scanning_changes || thread.is_started()) {` in `EditorFileSystem::_refresh_filesystem`\r\n- Adding a check on `refresh_queued` In `EditorFileSystem::_notification()` in case `NOTIFICATION_PROCESS`, exactly like the `prevent_recursive_process_hack`.\r\n\r\nI created a proof of concept PR the test my hypothesis: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/compare/master...Hilderin:godot:fix-double-scan-file-system","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2628623290/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2629013711","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102260#issuecomment-2629013711","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102260","id":2629013711,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6cs5DP","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/K